Touching this file starts .github/workflows/reversal-holdout.yml. The workflow is
branch-local, and GitHub offers workflow_dispatch only for workflows on the
default branch, so a gated push trigger is how it gets started without putting
research plumbing on main.

Two directives are read, both anchored at both ends so this prose cannot be
mistaken for one. The stage word is on its own line below. HARVEST_RUN_ID names
the run whose artifacts hold the harvested parts, and is required only for the
evaluate stage.

  STAGE must be the word harvest or the word evaluate.

STAGE=evaluate
HARVEST_RUN_ID=37250074970

REQUEST=2
